          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Summary: Observation of the movement of several white or red glowing points forming a triangle in the night sky: probable observation of Thai lanterns.",
          "translation_text_sha256": "ca6fb71ac4cfc491caf74ab1ce69764878f7e52e2f43753d955555994577b690"
